State 0

    0 $accept: • go $end

    CLASSNAME  shift, and go to state 1
    INTERPRET  shift, and go to state 2
    ADD        shift, and go to state 3

    $default  reduce using rule 3 (go)

    go                   go to state 4
    region               go to state 5
    classOrExtList.list  go to state 6
    classOrExtList.item  go to state 7
    class                go to state 8
    class.extension      go to state 9


